        "type": "workflow",
        "title": "NBR",
        "description": "Calculates the Normalised Burn Ratio, (nir - swir22) / (nir + swir22), for one Sentinel-2 L2A or Sentinel-2 ARD item over an area of interest, on the 10 m nir grid. Values are the same as EOPro's NBR. The output is clipped to the area and shown with the rdylgn colour map from -1 to 1.",
